  "\\begin{aligned} \\frac{\\nabla_{x_t} \\log p}{\\lVert \\nabla_{x_t} \\log p \\rVert} &= \\frac{(1-p)\\, g}{(1-p)\\, \\lVert g \\rVert} \\\\[4pt] &= \\frac{g}{\\lVert g \\rVert} \\end{aligned}"
 ],
